11:T4ab,Al Sadiq Health Care Centre (ASHCC) has been serving the Lahore community with dedication to compassionate, affordable, and high-quality healthcare. What began as a commitment to making quality medical care accessible to everyone has grown into a trusted centre offering a wide range of services — from routine checkups and preventive screenings to specialist consultations in cardiology, pediatrics, gynecology, dermatology, and general medicine.

Our team of experienced doctors, nurses, and support staff work together with one shared goal: to ensure every patient who walks through our doors receives the attention, respect, and care they deserve. We understand that visiting a healthcare centre can be stressful, which is why we've built our practice around patience, clear communication, and genuine concern for our patients' wellbeing — not just their symptoms.

At ASHCC, we hold ourselves to the highest standards of clinical excellence while never losing sight of the human side of medicine. Whether you're here for a routine visit or a more complex health concern, our team is committed to walking alongside you at every step, with honesty, empathy, and expertise you can rely on.2:["$","html",null,{"lang":"en","className":"poppins_e2db2705-module__uAHfgW__variable h-full","children":["$","body",null,{"className":"flex min-h-full flex-col","children":["$","$L10",null,{"initialSettings":{"_id":"6a69504d4035ece5d9af2e81","key":"site","siteName":"Al Sadiq Health Care Centre","tagline":"Compassionate Care, Trusted Excellence","aboutText":"$11","mission":"To provide accessible, compassionate, and high-quality healthcare to every patient who walks through our doors — with special dedication to the underserved and deserving members of our community who need care the most. At Al Sadiq Health Care Centre, we believe quality treatment should never be out of reach because of financial hardship, and we are committed to serving with dignity, honesty, and excellence at every step of the patient journey.","vision":"To be Lahore's most trusted healthcare centre — a place where every patient, regardless of background or means, receives world-class medical attention delivered with empathy and respect. We envision a community where preventive care, timely treatment, and compassionate support are available to all, building a healthier future one patient at a time.","address":"Pindistop, F86G+7VC, Stop Kot Lakhpat, Lahore, 54670, Pakistan","phone":"03296127672","whatsapp":"+923296127672","email":"support@alsadiqhealthcare.online","mapEmbedUrl":"<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d54473.09017304393!2d74.24545925638786!3d31.42602265168924!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x391907005f906401%3A0x4d605c9333f5bf61!2sAl-Sadiq%20Health%20Care%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2s!4v1785294978822!5m2!1sen!2s\" width=\"60